   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_28"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Can I bring my baby's pram onto the bus folded or does it have to be folded?",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.46,
   "block": "public_transport.dlg29",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Ha, I think you mean unfolded? On many buses, yes, there's a space for prams and wheelchairs.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 1.05,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "public_transport.dlg29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Yes, sorry, unfolded. Long day.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.89,
   "block": "public_transport.dlg29",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "No worries. Wheelchair users usually get priority for that space, so you might be asked to move or fold it if someone needs it.",
   "est_sec": 7.54,
   "gap_before": 0.67,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "public_transport.dlg29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Julian, are you going to the gym before or after work?",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 1.23,
   "block": "nq_social_012",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "other_name",
   "phrasing": "nq_social_012",
   "name_pos": "start",
   "addressee": "Julian"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Fair enough. What if",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 2.4,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "public_transport.dlg29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "it's already taken by another pram?",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 2.62,
   "block": "public_transport.dlg29",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then you might have to wait for the next bus or fold it. Some drivers allow two if there's room.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.64,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "public_transport.dlg29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Got it, thanks.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
